WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.324
Your Inbox holds every question agents are waiting on you to answer.

00:00:07.324 --> 00:00:11.398
This one asks which sign-in path to use.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.038
Pick an option, add a note, and answer.

00:00:17.038 --> 00:00:20.411
The answered ask leaves your Inbox.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:31.904
The answer is written into the issue's spec, inside the decision block: who answered, the option they chose, and their note.
